            "advisory": "Affected versions of the langchain-core package are vulnerable to Path Traversal due to improper validation of file paths embedded in deserialized prompt configuration dictionaries. The load_prompt() and load_prompt_from_config() functions in langchain_core.prompts.loading, through _load_template(), _load_examples(), and _load_few_shot_prompt(), read attacker-influenced values such as template_path, suffix_path, prefix_path, examples, and example_prompt_path without blocking absolute paths or .. traversal sequences before accessing .txt, .json, or .yaml files on disk.",
