            },
            "advisory": "Affected versions of the langchain-core package are vulnerable to Unsafe Deserialisation due to runtime code paths that call `load()` with `allowed_objects=\"all\"`, permitting any trusted LangChain-serialisable object to be revived from attacker-controlled input. The `RunnableWithMessageHistory`, `astream_log()`, and `astream_events(version=\"v1\")` API surfaces deserialise attacker-supplied nested dictionaries preserved in run inputs or outputs without adequate restriction. An attacker who can submit untrusted structured input to an affected application can inject LangChain serialised constructor payloads to instantiate classes with untrusted constructor arguments.",
